senses.gloss:
(I)--a श्राद्ध performed by इक्ष्वाकु, which led to the banishment of his son विकुक्षि (s.v.);
1: भा. IX. 6. 6; Br. III. १७. 2-7; ६३. ११; वा. ८८. ११-19.
a युगाडि for साधरण श्राद्ध;
2: M. १७. 2, 5.
the eighth day after full moon on which Manes are worshipped; three are distinguished, in the month of चैत्र, of पौष and माघ;
3: वा. ८१. 2;
sacred to काव्य pitr2s.
4: वा. ५६. १९.
